### Carrybee Integration Testing
### Use REST Client extension in VS Code or import to Postman

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@merchantToken = your-merchant-token-here
@hubManagerToken = your-hub-manager-token-here
@carrybeeProviderId = your-carrybee-provider-uuid

### ============================================
### SETUP: Get Authentication Tokens
### ============================================

### 1. Register Merchant (or login if exists)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/merchant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testmerchant@carrybee.test",
  "password": "Test1234!",
  "full_name": "Carrybee Test Merchant",
  "phone": "01712345678"
}

### 2. Login Hub Manager
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hubmanager@example.com",
  "password": "your-password"
}

### ============================================
### CARRYBEE LOCATIONS
### ============================================

### 3. Get Cities
GET {{baseUrl}}/carrybee/locations/cities

### 4. Get Zones for Dhaka (city_id = 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/carrybee/locations/cities/1/zones

### 5. Get Areas for Dhaka/Uttara (city_id=1, zone_id=5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/carrybee/locations/cities/1/zones/5/areas

### 6. Search Area
GET {{baseUrl}}/carrybee/locations/search?query=uttara

### ============================================
### STORE MANAGEMENT
### ============================================

### 7. Create Store with Carrybee IDs
POST {{baseUrl}}/stores
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "business_name": "Test Shop Carrybee",
  "business_address": "123 Test Street, Dhaka 1230",
  "phone_number": "01712345678",
  "district": "Dhaka",
  "thana": "Uttara",
  "area": "Sector 3",
  "carrybee_city_id": 1,
  "carrybee_zone_id": 5,
  "carrybee_area_id": 23
}

### 8. Get Carrybee Stores (from Carrybee API)
GET {{baseUrl}}/carrybee/stores
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}

### ============================================
### PARCEL CREATION
### ============================================

### 9. Create Test Parcel
POST {{baseUrl}}/parcels
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "store_id": "your-store-id-here",
  "delivery_coverage_area_id": "your-coverage-area-id",
  "customer_name": "Test Customer",
  "customer_phone": "01798765432",
  "customer_address": "456 Customer Street, Dhaka 1230",
  "product_price": 1000,
  "product_weight": 0.5,
  "product_description": "Test Electronics"
}

### ============================================
### CARRYBEE ASSIGNMENT
### ============================================

### 10. Assign Parcel to Carrybee
POST {{baseUrl}}/carrybee/parcels/your-parcel-id/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{hubManagerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider_id": "{{carrybeeProviderId}}",
  "notes": "Test assignment to Carrybee"
}

### 11. Bulk Assign Parcels to Carrybee
POST {{baseUrl}}/carrybee/parcels/assign/carrybee
Authorization: Bearer {{hubManagerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parcel_ids": ["parcel-id-1", "parcel-id-2"],
  "provider_id": "{{carrybeeProviderId}}",
  "notes": "Bulk test assignment"
}

### ============================================
### WEBHOOK TESTING (Simulate Carrybee Events)
### NOTE: Webhooks do NOT require JWT token, only signature header
### Replace "your-carrybee-consignment-id" with actual consignment_id
### ============================================

### 12. Test Webhook: Order Picked
POST http://localhost:3000/webhooks/carrybee
Content-Type: application/json
X-Carrybee-Webhook-Signature: carrybee-webhook-secret-change-in-production

{
  "event": "order.picked",
  "store_id": "CSTORE-123456",
  "consignment_id": "your-carrybee-consignment-id",
  "merchant_order_id": "TRK-001",
  "timestamptz": "2026-02-06T10:00:00Z"
}

### 13. Test Webhook: Order At Sorting Hub
POST http://localhost:3000/webhooks/carrybee
Content-Type: application/json
X-Carrybee-Webhook-Signature: carrybee-webhook-secret-change-in-production

{
  "event": "order.at-the-sorting-hub",
  "store_id": "CSTORE-123456",
  "consignment_id": "your-carrybee-consignment-id",
  "merchant_order_id": "TRK-001",
  "timestamptz": "2026-02-06T11:00:00Z"
}

### 14. Test Webhook: Order In Transit
POST http://localhost:3000/webhooks/carrybee
Content-Type: application/json
X-Carrybee-Webhook-Signature: carrybee-webhook-secret-change-in-production

{
  "event": "order.in-transit",
  "store_id": "CSTORE-123456",
  "consignment_id": "your-carrybee-consignment-id",
  "merchant_order_id": "TRK-001",
  "timestamptz": "2026-02-06T12:00:00Z"
}

### 15. Test Webhook: Order Out for Delivery
POST http://localhost:3000/webhooks/carrybee
Content-Type: application/json
X-Carrybee-Webhook-Signature: carrybee-webhook-secret-change-in-production

{
  "event": "order.assigned-for-delivery",
  "store_id": "CSTORE-123456",
  "consignment_id": "your-carrybee-consignment-id",
  "merchant_order_id": "TRK-001",
  "timestamptz": "2026-02-06T13:00:00Z"
}

### 16. Test Webhook: Order Delivered (with COD)
POST http://localhost:3000/webhooks/carrybee
Content-Type: application/json
X-Carrybee-Webhook-Signature: carrybee-webhook-secret-change-in-production

{
  "event": "order.delivered",
  "store_id": "CSTORE-123456",
  "consignment_id": "your-carrybee-consignment-id",
  "merchant_order_id": "TRK-001",
  "timestamptz": "2026-02-06T14:00:00Z",
  "collectable_amount": "1000.00",
  "collected_amount": "1000.00",
  "cod_fee": 10,
  "delivery_fee": "60.00"
}

### 17. Test Webhook: Delivery Failed
POST http://localhost:3000/webhooks/carrybee
Content-Type: application/json
X-Carrybee-Webhook-Signature: carrybee-webhook-secret-change-in-production

{
  "event": "order.delivery-failed",
  "store_id": "CSTORE-123456",
  "consignment_id": "your-carrybee-consignment-id",
  "merchant_order_id": "TRK-001",
  "timestamptz": "2026-02-06T14:30:00Z",
  "reason": "Customer not available",
  "attempt": 1
}

### 18. Test Webhook: Order Returned
POST http://localhost:3000/webhooks/carrybee
Content-Type: application/json
X-Carrybee-Webhook-Signature: carrybee-webhook-secret-change-in-production

{
  "event": "order.returned",
  "store_id": "CSTORE-123456",
  "consignment_id": "your-carrybee-consignment-id",
  "merchant_order_id": "TRK-001",
  "timestamptz": "2026-02-06T15:00:00Z",
  "reason": "Customer refused delivery",
  "delivery_fee": "60.00"
}

### 19. Test Webhook: Returned to Merchant
POST http://localhost:3000/webhooks/carrybee
Content-Type: application/json
X-Carrybee-Webhook-Signature: carrybee-webhook-secret-change-in-production

{
  "event": "order.returned-to-merchant",
  "store_id": "CSTORE-123456",
  "consignment_id": "your-carrybee-consignment-id",
  "merchant_order_id": "TRK-001",
  "timestamptz": "2026-02-06T16:00:00Z",
  "reason": "Return completed"
}

### 20. Test Webhook: Pickup Cancelled
POST http://localhost:3000/webhooks/carrybee
Content-Type: application/json
X-Carrybee-Webhook-Signature: carrybee-webhook-secret-change-in-production

{
  "event": "order.pickup-cancelled",
  "store_id": "CSTORE-123456",
  "consignment_id": "your-carrybee-consignment-id",
  "merchant_order_id": "TRK-001",
  "timestamptz": "2026-02-06T09:30:00Z",
  "reason": "Merchant cancelled"
}

### ============================================
### COD COLLECTION
### ============================================

### 21. View Carrybee Cleared Deliveries
GET {{baseUrl}}/hubs/parcels/carrybee-cleared-deliveries
Authorization: Bearer {{hubManagerToken}}

### 22. Collect COD from Carrybee
POST {{baseUrl}}/hubs/finance/collect-cod-carrybee/{{carrybeeProviderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hubManagerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "counted_amount": 1000,
  "collection_notes": "Cash collected from Carrybee representative"
}

### ============================================
### MERCHANT SETTLEMENT
### ============================================

### 23. Generate Invoice (Including Carrybee Parcels)
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchant-invoices/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{hubManagerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchant_id": "your-merchant-id",
  "parcel_ids": ["parcel-1", "parcel-2", "parcel-3"]
}

### 24. Pay Merchant Invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchant-invoices/your-invoice-id/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{hubManagerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payment_method": "BANK_TRANSFER",
  "payment_reference": "TXN-TEST-12345",
  "paid_amount": 4400
}

### ============================================
### VERIFICATION QUERIES
### ============================================

### 25. Get Parcel Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/parcels/your-parcel-id
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}

### 26. Get Hub Finance Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/hubs/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{hubManagerToken}}

### 27. Get Merchant Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/parcels/merchant-dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{merchantToken}}
